+	// 5.1 — the director's map-growth branch (ODN-7, growth.odin): terminals
+	// appear over time, deterministically from the seed + the executed tick
+	// (the rng stream — never wall-clock), biased outward from the
+	// player-placed router mesh; every spawn is E31-valid (connectable-within-
+	// span + min separation, rejection-sampled from the same rng stream).
+	// Growth is run setup (growth_enabled — re-created identically on replay
+	// like the fixture); disabled (every legacy run) it draws ZERO rng and
+	// mutates nothing, so existing goldens stay byte-identical. The plan is
+	// applied BEFORE the flow so this tick's spawns are live to demand picks
+	// (connectable-by-construction); a spawn bumps Topology.gen so the rule-1
+	// rebuilds below pick up the new nodes. Growth state never enters the
